msgid "Configured upstream"
msgstr "配置的上游地址"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/client.html:14
msgid "Read JSON"
msgstr "读取 JSON"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/client.html:15
msgid "Observe upstream 404"
msgstr "观察上游 404"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/client.html:16
msgid "Observe timeout"
msgstr "观察超时"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/client.html:17
msgid "Read byte stream"
msgstr "读取字节流"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/client.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Each operation waits at most %(seconds)s seconds, with no retries or "
"redirects. The delay endpoint requests 10 seconds; an early upstream "
"response is shown as it actually arrives."
msgstr "每次操作最多等待 %(seconds)s 秒，不重试、不跟随重定向。延迟接口请求等待 10 秒；如果上游提前返回，则显示实际响应。"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/client.html:20
msgid ""
"The stream endpoint requests 65536 bytes. Python reads chunks and "
"computes SHA-256 without saving a file; the browser receives the final "
"result, not live progress."
msgstr "流接口请求 65536 字节。Python 分块读取并计算 SHA-256，不保存文件；浏览器收到的是最终结果，而不是实时进度。"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/client.html:21
msgid ""
"The upstream sees the server address, Demo User-Agent and fixed example "
"parameters, never your login cookie or database records. Public httpbin "
"may be unavailable; configure your own compatible instance when needed."
msgstr ""
"上游可看到服务器地址、Demo User-Agent 和固定示例参数，但不会收到登录 Cookie 或数据库记录。公共 httpbin "
"可能不可用，必要时可配置自己的兼容实例。"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/client.html:28
msgid "No upstream request has been sent. Choose Read JSON to begin."
msgstr "尚未发送上游请求，请点击“读取 JSON”开始。"

